### Weighings — VOID (logical delete): status inactive and net weight removed from the lot (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings/{{id}}/deactivate

### Weighings — re-activate a voided weighing (expects 200 OK; net weight added back)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}
